---
import { getCollection } from "astro:content";
import ContentSection from "~/components/content-section.astro";
import ShowcaseCard from "~/components/showcase-card.astro";

const featuredSites = await getCollection(
  "showcase",
  ({ data }) => "featured" in data,
);
const orderedSites = featuredSites.sort(
  (a, b) => a.data.featured! - b.data.featured!,
);
---

<ContentSection title="W3W VS ETF" id="portal">
  <Fragment slot="lead">
    Tokenized real estate as Bitcoin involves creating digital tokens representing fractional ownership of physical properties on the blockchain, allowing investors to directly own and trade real estate as a W3W. In contrast, Bitcoin ETFs allow investors to gain exposure to Bitcoin's price movement without owning the cryptocurrency itself, by holding shares of a fund that tracks Bitcoin’s value.
  </Fragment>
  
  <div class="max-w-6xl space-y-2">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
      {orderedSites.map((site) => <ShowcaseCard site={site} />)}
    </div>
  </div>
</ContentSection>
